# Keep compact evidence summaries in Git. Raw device screenshots, UI dumps,
# JSON traces and logs stay local and can be archived as release artifacts.
/docs/evidence/**
!/docs/evidence/**/
!/docs/evidence/**/*.md

# Keep only reproducible baselines, datasets, manifests and final summaries.
# Large generated failure listings and intermediate optimization rounds stay local.
